-09-21T09:40:57.103749+00:00", "entity_type": "solution_rule", "applicability": "paint_wood_bare — General wood behaviour.", "evidence_strength": "strong_consensus", "supporting_passage": "The USDA Wood Handbook finishing chapter describes the effects of moisture, sunlight and weathering on wood finishes.", "relevant_section_page": "Chapter 16 — moisture, sunlight and weathering"}, {"id": "f39091dd-7530-4f29-b1c4-615067448f6a", "active": true, "entity_id": "2bc46cd1-375b-41c2-b048-ee85c64f0063", "source_id": "b4b2697f-66a3-41d2-a8a9-2c2a67161f02", "created_at": "2026-09-21T09:40:57.103749+00:00", "entity_type": "solution_rule", "applicability": "waterproof_roof_standing_water — Professional guidance; not Greek building law.", "evidence_strength": "common_professional_practice", "supporting_passage": "LRWA guidance addresses flat-roof falls, drainage and ponding as design/specification matters that must be assessed rather than covered over.", "relevant_section_page": "Flat-roof falls, ponding and drainage"}, {"id": "bf2a6ef3-7163-494f-a769-e6bc60515292", "active": true, "entity_id": "2f94615d-9c0c-4f9a-a45e-24787c200026", "source_id": "5779529c-513c-4ac6-989c-1727d0c3146f", "created_at": "2026-09-21T09:40:57.103749+00:00", "entity_type": "solution_rule", "applicability": "paint_exterior_repaint_sound — The standard is not quoted; exact temperature/humidity/rain limits are intentionally deferred to Layer B.", "evidence_strength": "context_dependent", "supporting_passage": "BS 6150 addresses painting practice and environmental/application considerations, while exact numerical product limits remain dependent on the selected coating documentation.", "relevant_section_page": "Scope: preparation, painting and maintenance"}, {"id": "b0ee69d3-b7a4-4e54-bdd9-b496f22ac180", "active": true, "entity_id": "35920272-c312-4bab-bffc-2272a38b5e5e", "source_id": "5ef44a5a-f6fe-44e4-b703-6dc86e02948e", "created_at": "2026-09-21T09:40:57.103749+00:00", "entity_type": "solution_rule", "a